  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The shared structural MRI preprocessing backbone used by fMRIPrep and dMRIPrep — teams using either of those tools already depend on sMRIPrep indirectly. Apache-2.0, BIDS-compliant, integrates FreeSurfer/ANTs/FSL. Assess rather than Adopt because it functions more as middleware than a standalone end-user tool — most researchers interact with it through fMRIPrep rather than directly.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-05-29",
